 Cucumber extracts—all celebrated for their skin-loving properties. This cleanser not only removes dirt and excess oil but also deeply hydrates and nurtures sensitive skin. Feel the calming effect reduce redness and irritation, while natural pore-tightening agents refine your skin’s texture for a smoother, youthful appearance.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Perfect for everyday use, Prana’s Rose &amp; Jasmine Face Cleanser balances and revitalizes your skin without stripping essential moisture. Experience the confidence of a radiant glow and refreshed complexion that lasts all day. Make the natural choice that elevates your beauty routine and leaves your skin feeling truly cared for.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXpcMUL7gI_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggXpcMUL7gI_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0803/9700/9186/files/gempages_546167947945575666-721453e4-3b90-4ec9-a376-8ca54d244e8e.png"}],
